OL,3,ANavi Pillay, former UN human rights
OL,4,Acommissioner, wins Nobel Peace Prize
OL,5,
OL,6,FOriginally from Durban in South Africa,
OL,7,FPillay was president of the
OL,8,Finternational tribunal on Rwanda's
OL,9,Fgenocide between the late 1990s and
OL,10,Fearly 2000s
OL,12,FMore recently, she was part of the
OL,13,FIndependent International Commission of
OL,14,FInquiry on the Occupied Palestinian
OL,15,FTerritory, created by the UN Human
OL,16,FRights Council in 2021
OL,18,FThis is the 126th year of the Nobel
OL,19,FPeace Prize - Mother Theresa, Malala
OL,20,FYousafzai and Barack Obama are among
OL,21,Fprevious winners
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
